<% content_for :title, 'Privacy — stylish' %>
<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>stylish is a demo of Kiosk. This page says what it stores and for how long.</p>
<h2>What stylish stores</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Accounts.</strong> An account that an AI assistant opens here has no e-mail address and no password.
    The demo's sample accounts, which you can sign in with, have an e-mail address and a hash of a
    password.</li>
  <li><strong>Your appointments.</strong> The salon, the service, the time, the price and when your visit was
    recorded.</li>
</ul>
<%= render 'privacy/kiosk' %>
<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<p>We keep everything above that names no other time until we reset this demo. We reset it by hand, with no
  fixed schedule, and a reset deletes every account and every row named on this page.</p>
